[{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0049","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0049.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1175","title":"Fetchmail 6.0.0 及更早版本 DNS getmxrecord 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Fetchmail 6.0.0 及更早版本中的 getmxrecord 函数在处理恶意 DNS 服务器返回的特制 DNS 数据包时，未正确校验数据边界，存在越界读取漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过控制恶意 DNS 服务器向目标 Fetchmail 客户端发送畸形 DNS 响应数据包，触发越界读取操作，导致 Fetchmail 进程崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响所有 Fetchmail 6.0.0 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1175"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-10-11T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:52.573","remediation":"升级 Fetchmail 至 6.1.0 或更高版本。各发行版用户：Red Hat 用户安装 RHSA-2002:215 提供的更新包；Debian 用户安装 DSA-171 提供的更新包；Mandrake 用户安装 MDKSA-2002:063 提供的更新包。如无法升级，可在 DNS 解析层面配置可信 DNS 服务器并过滤畸形 DNS 响应作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000531","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103340148625187&w=2","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2002-215.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-171","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10203.php","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2002/MDKSA-2002-063.php","http://www.linuxsecurity.com/advisories/other_advisory-2402.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5826","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2002/CVE-2002-1175.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/528991f6906b29893dd0e43e65862cd92fd607c8/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1175.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1175","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2002.txt","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-1175.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-33hc-jm79-92r9/GHSA-33hc-jm79-92r9.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/redhat-RHSA-2002-216.nasl","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/adb0abfbea757d46e846ba7d3640d43b01b979fe/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-1175.json","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-171.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_149400_149500.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0049.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0048","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0048.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1174","title":"Fetchmail 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Fetchmail 6.0.0 及更早版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者无需认证即可利用该漏洞。漏洞存在于 readheaders 函数处理超长邮件头以及 parse_received 函数解析超长 Received 头时，未正确校验数据长度导致缓冲区溢出。攻击者可通过向目标邮件服务器发送特制的恶意邮件触发此漏洞，造成服务崩溃（拒绝服务）或执行任意代码。该漏洞影响所有 Fetchmail 6.0.0 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1174"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-10-11T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:52.433","remediation":"升级 Fetchmail 至 6.1.0 或更高版本，该版本修复了 readheaders 和 parse_received 函数中的缓冲区溢出问题。如无法立即升级，可在邮件服务器端限制邮件头长度，或使用防火墙限制对 Fetchmail 服务的访问来源 IP。Red Hat 用户可安装 RHSA-2002:216 提供的更新包，Debian 用户可安装 DSA-171 提供的更新包。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000531","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103340148625187&w=2","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2002-215.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-171","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10203.php","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2002/MDKSA-2002-063.php","http://www.linuxsecurity.com/advisories/other_advisory-2402.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5825","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5827","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2002/CVE-2002-1174.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/528991f6906b29893dd0e43e65862cd92fd607c8/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1174.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1174","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2002.txt","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-1174.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vqhj-2h3q-6ghm/GHSA-vqhj-2h3q-6ghm.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/redhat-RHSA-2002-216.nasl","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/adb0abfbea757d46e846ba7d3640d43b01b979fe/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-1174.json","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-171.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_149400_149500.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0048.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0047","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0047.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1170","title":"Net-SNMP SNMP守护进程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Net-SNMP（原 ucd-snmp）软件包 5.0.1 至 5.0.5 版本的 SNMP 守护进程中，snmp_agent.c 文件的 handle_var_requests 函数存在空指针解引用漏洞。未经认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的 SNMP 请求触发该漏洞，导致 SNMP 守护进程崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响范围广泛，攻击复杂度低，无需任何身份验证即可远程利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1170"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-10-11T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:52.313","remediation":"升级 Net-SNMP 至 5.0.6 或更高版本（当前最新为 5.9.4）。Red Hat 用户应安装 RHSA-2002:228 提供的更新包。临时缓解措施：在防火墙上限制 SNMP 服务（UDP 161 端口）仅允许可信来源访问，或在 snmpd.conf 中配置访问控制列表（com2sec/group/view 指令）限制可查询的 MIB 范围。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103359362020365&w=2","http://sourceforge.net/forum/forum.php?forum_id=216532","http://www.idefense.com/advisory/10.02.02.txt","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-228.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5862","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10250","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2002/CVE-2002-1170.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/528991f6906b29893dd0e43e65862cd92fd607c8/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1170.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1170","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2002.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f2c577e1255b2c3fd617b7f1c499a222feb7b668/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1170.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-1170.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-5j37-qvcv-4rf2/GHSA-5j37-qvcv-4rf2.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x6000/5862/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_149400_149500.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1170.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0047.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0046","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0046.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1165","title":"Sendmail SMRSH 双管道符绕过访问验证漏洞","description":"Sendmail 8.12.6、8.11.6-15 及 1998 年 5 月 19 日之后的部分 8.11 版本中，Sendmail Consortium 的受限 Shell（SMRSH）存在访问验证漏洞。攻击者可通过在命令中插入 \"||\" 双管道序列或 \"/\" 字符绕过 smrsh 的指令限制，执行未授权的额外命令。该漏洞需要本地访问权限，利用难度较低，成功利用后可导致机密性、完整性和可用性部分受损，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1165"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-10-11T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:51.747","remediation":"升级 Sendmail 至 8.12.7 或更高版本，该漏洞已在后续版本中修复。如无法立即升级，可禁用 smrsh（Sendmail Restricted Shell）功能，改用其他邮件过滤机制（如 milter）替代；或在 smrsh 配置中移除对危险命令（如 sh、perl 等）的授权，限制可执行命令列表。对于 Debian/Red Hat 等发行版，安装对应安全更新（如 Debian DSA-183、Red Hat RHSA-2002:217）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000532","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103350914307274&w=2","http://secunia.com/advisories/7826","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10232.php","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2002:083","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-073.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5845","http://www.sendmail.org/smrsh.adv.txt","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21884","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/377bb49f7479dd297ab5004f75a37c291a136578/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1165.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1165","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2002-1165.md","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2002-1165","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/db909d46c3d9b98ec1f95daa3c88d7a8990ea8f5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-48jx-mwjr-89wq/GHSA-48jx-mwjr-89wq.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/mandrake_MDKSA-2002-083.nasl","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1165.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/pre2008/SHN_Sendmail_DoublePipe.nasl","https://github.com/chihsuan/search-engine/blob/9dcdd3e644469883f53565740f0ba8ff617c5120/Data/E99D88C1-C798-40D7-BB8C-47E6405B9469.txt","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2002-1165"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0046.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0043","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0043.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1156","title":"Apache HTTP Server 2.0.42 CGI 源代码信息泄露漏洞","description":"Apache 2.0.42 存在信息泄漏漏洞，当服务器目录同时启用 WebDAV 和 CGI 功能时，远程攻击者可通过向该目录发送特制的 POST 请求，绕过访问控制限制，直接获取 CGI 脚本的源代码而非执行结果。该漏洞导致敏感业务逻辑、数据库凭证等源码信息泄露，攻击面取决于服务器上 CGI 脚本的部署情况，无需身份认证即可远程利用。CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1156"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-10-11T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:49.867","remediation":"立即将 Apache HTTP Server 升级至 2.0.43 或更高版本（该漏洞仅影响 2.0.42）。由于 Apache 2.0 系列已于 2013 年停止维护，建议升级至当前受支持的 2.4.x 版本。如无法升级，可在配置中禁用 WebDAV 模块（注释或移除 `mod_dav` 加载指令），或确保启用 CGI 的目录不启用 WebDAV。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://online.securityfocus.com/advisories/4617","http://www.apache.org/dist/httpd/CHANGES_2.0","http://www.apacheweek.com/issues/02-10-04","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/910713","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6065","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10499","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/54a42d4b01968df1117cea77fc53d6beb931c0e05936ad02af93e9ac%