E-2002-1154.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1154","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2002-1154.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1b84eedba993546f37a880c6d2d084176a1f04a7/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1154.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/db909d46c3d9b98ec1f95daa3c88d7a8990ea8f5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-gmg7-qgc5-8mvp/GHSA-gmg7-qgc5-8mvp.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_100_200.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x90000/89511/info.html","https://github.com/Team-Atlanta/aixcc-asc-atlantis/blob/785c446f980e12155935db586aa30c3b54adcc86/crs/src/crs-patch/smith/smith/lib/cwe/raw/CWE-779.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1154.json","https://github.com/jmohitz/SECAI/blob/33119e592f944e313664a5f75ae76284ea4b3fe8/data/CWE/779.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0042.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0042.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0041","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0041.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1146","title":"ISC BIND 及 glibc DNS 解析器库读取缓冲区溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"BIND 4 及 BIND 8.2.x 的存根解析器库，以及 glibc 2.2.5 及更早版本、libc 和 libresolv 等其他库，在处理 DNS 响应时使用了最大缓冲区大小而非实际数据大小，导致存根解析器读取超出实际边界（即\"读取缓冲区溢出\"）。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向目标发送特制的 DNS 响应触发此漏洞，造成目标服务或系统崩溃（拒绝服务）。该漏洞影响范围广泛，涉及众多 Unix/Linux 系统中使用的 DNS 解析库。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1146"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-10-11T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:48.547","remediation":"升级 glibc 至 2.2.5 以上版本（如 2.3.x 系列），或安装对应发行版安全更新：Red Hat 请安装 RHSA-2002:197 / RHSA-2002:258 / RHSA-2003:022 提供的 glibc 更新；NetBSD 请应用 SA2002-015 补丁；Mandrake 请安装 MDKSA-2004:009 更新。如使用 BIND 4/8，建议升级至 BIND 9 系列。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000535","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10295.php","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/738331","http://www.mandrakesoft.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2004:009","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-197.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-258.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-022.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-212.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/377bb49f7479dd297ab5004f75a37c291a136578/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1146.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1146","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2002-1146.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1b84eedba993546f37a880c6d2d084176a1f04a7/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1146.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/db909d46c3d9b98ec1f95daa3c88d7a8990ea8f5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-6w68-qf8p-27ph/GHSA-6w68-qf8p-27ph.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/redhat-RHSA-2003-022.nasl","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/mandrake_MDKSA-2004-009.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_149400_149500.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1146.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0041.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0027","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0027.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0840","title":"Apache HTTP Server 跨站脚本攻击","description":"Apache HTTP Server 1.3.26及2.0.42之前版本的默认错误页面存在跨站脚本(XSS)漏洞。当服务器配置中将UseCanonicalName设为\"Off\"且支持通配符DNS解析时，远程攻击者可通过在HTTP请求的Host头部中注入恶意脚本代码，当其他用户访问默认错误页面时该脚本将被执行，导致敏感信息泄露、会话劫持等攻击。攻击者无需身份认证即可实施攻击。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0840"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-10-11T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:14.310","remediation":"升级 Apache HTTP Server 至 1.3.27 及以上版本（1.3.x 分支）或 2.0.43 及以上版本（2.0.x 分支）。如无法立即升级，修改 httpd.conf 将 `UseCanonicalName` 指令设为 `On` 或 `DNS`，并关闭通配符 DNS 解析支持，可缓解通过 Host 头部注入恶意脚本的攻击风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-10/0254.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2002-q4/0003.html","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000530","http://marc.info/?l=apache-httpd-announce&m=103367938230488&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103357160425708&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103376585508776&w=2","http://online.securityfocus.com/advisories/4617","http://www.apacheweek.com/issues/02-10-04","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-187","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-188","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-195","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/240329","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2002/MDKSA-2002-068.php","http://www.linuxsecurity.com/advisories/other_advisory-2414.html","http://www.osvdb.org/862","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-222.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-243.html","http://www