造恶意文档诱导用户打开，从而在目标系统上执行任意代码。该漏洞影响多个 Unix/Linux 发行版中的 GV 系列工具，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0838"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-10-10T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:13.880","remediation":"升级 gv 至 3.5.9 及以上版本，升级 KDE 至 3.0.4 及以上版本（kghostview 漏洞已修复），或为 KDE 2.2.2/3.0.3 应用官方安全补丁。各发行版用户应安装对应安全更新：Red Hat 安装 RHSA-2002:207/212/220，Debian 安装 DSA-176/179/182，Mandrake 安装 MDKSA-2002:069/071，Caldera OpenLinux 安装 CSSA-2002-053.0。临时缓解措施为不打开来源可疑的 PDF 和 PostScript 文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000542","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103305615613319&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103305778615625&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103487806800388&w=2","http://sunsolve.sun.com/pub-cgi/retrieve.pl?doc=fsalert/47780&zone_32=category:security","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-176","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-179","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-182","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10201.php","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/600777","http://www.kde.org/info/security/advisory-20021008-1.txt","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2002:069","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2002:071","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-207.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-212.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-220.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5808","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21872","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2002/CVE-2002-0838.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/362345baaa3b0376b2369a7901885756e250334b/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0838.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0838","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf