USE Linux 用户安装 SA 2002_035 安全更新。如无法立即升级，可在 faxgetty 配置中限制客户端连接来源 IP 或禁用远程传真接收功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-07/0358.html","http://bugs.hylafax.org/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=312","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-148","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9729.php","http://www.mandrakesoft.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2002:055","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2002_035_hylafax.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5349","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7d4778b18ea29de57c8a889212050a9d38e2d2cb/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1050.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1050","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2002-1050.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1b84eedba993546f37a880c6d2d084176a1f04a7/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1050.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-5cm6-6924-hvfr/GHSA-5cm6-6924-hvfr.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/suse_SA_2002_035.nasl","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-148.nasl","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--53eca135-3c3a-445b-8268-f1fedccf87fe.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/264183bcd01e2c9ec3804dc74ef248df8e8380e5/tracker/DSA/DSA-148.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/2c0acf37ebbe7ba2baad7e8834435793efa1e9cc/2002/CVE-2002-1050.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0038.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0037","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0037.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1049","title":"HylaFAX faxgetty 格式化字符串拒绝服务漏洞","description":"HylaFAX 传真服务器组件 faxgetty 在处理 TSI（Transmitting Subscriber Identification）数据元素时存在格式化字符串漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标系统发送特制的 TSI 数据，触发格式化字符串处理缺陷，导致 faxgetty 进程崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 HylaFAX 4.1.3 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。建议用户升级至 HylaFAX 4.1.3 或更高版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1049"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-10-04T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:37.927","remediation":"升级 HylaFAX 至 4.1.3 或更高版本。该版本已修复 faxgetty 组件处理 TSI 数据元素时的格式化字符串漏洞。如无法立即升级，可在 /etc/inetd.conf 中注释 faxgetty 服务行并重启 inetd 以临时禁用传真接收功能；或在防火墙层面限制对 faxgetty 服务端口（通常为 4559/tcp）的访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-07/0358.html","http://bugs.hylafax.org/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=300","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-148","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9728.php","http://www.mandrakesoft.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2002:055","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2002_035_hylafax.html","http://www.osvdb.org/5002","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5348","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7d4778b18ea29de57c8a889212050a9d38e2d2cb/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1049.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1049","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2002-1049.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1b84eedba993546f37a880c6d2d084176a1f04a7/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1049.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2qfv-hf75-cqrh/GHSA-2qfv-hf75-cq