46 或更高版本，该版本已修复日期解析函数中对超大/负值年份未做校验导致陷入死循环的问题。也可在网络边界部署邮件过滤设备，拦截含有畸变 Date 头字段的邮件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://sourceforge.net/project/shownotes.php?release_id=93065","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9228.php","http://www.osvdb.org/5052","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4908","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9342e5394ee109ffc3617b5105797cdfcfcb78cf/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0914.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0914","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2002-0914.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/61756b9c4d4c30577cc003b0b28e3db71ca30a1e/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0914.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2fx9-2g54-566x/GHSA-2fx9-2g54-566x.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0914.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_149200_149300.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--49b68e72-95da-4871-97b2-57f2c4c8496a.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--49b68e72-95da-4871-97b2-57f2c4c8496a.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0035.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0034","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0034.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0906","title":"Sendmail DNS查询TXT记录响应处理缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Sendmail 8.12.5 之前版本中，当配置使用自定义 DNS 映射查询 TXT 记录时，其处理 DNS 应答的代码存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过控制恶意 DNS 服务器向目标 Sendmail 服务器发送特制的 DNS 应答数据包，触发缓冲区溢出，导致服务拒绝响应，甚至可能执行任意代码。该漏洞影响广泛部署的邮件传输代理软件，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0906"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2002-10-04T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:21.937","remediation":"升级 Sendmail 至 8.12.5 或更高版本，该版本已修复 parse_dns_reply 函数中的缓冲区溢出问题。如无法立即升级，可临时移除或禁用自定义 DNS map（custom DNS map）中对 TXT 记录的查询配置，避免向不可信 DNS 服务器发起 TXT 记录请求以降低风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9443.php","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/814627","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5122","http://www.sendmail.org/8.12.5.html","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A2183","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0906.json","https://github.com/REMath/implementations/blob/045b59dc77d5bd3e9a14713898ebcfdebacd11e9/tanalysis/tanalysis/verisec%20v1.0/sendmail/CVE-2002-0906/README","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0906","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2002-0906.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c872795777255e25a47f155fd6d323c05ea13ab9/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0906.json","https://github.com/dceara/tanalysis/blob/5496d33e632fdb8852ce65082fdb31aec0fab8d4/tanalysis/verisec%20v1.0/sendmail/CVE-2002-0906/README.STAC","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-www2-vw26-5r85/GHSA-www2-vw26-5r85.json","https://github.com/chihsuan/search-engine/blob/9dcdd3e644469883